    Make session navigation and turn-start correctness safe (R2, R3, R4, R7)
    
    - loadHistory clears the transcript immediately (cancels pending Markdown and
      reasoning frames, messages.clear, showEmpty) and resets the status context,
      so a transcript from the previous session is never visible under a newly
      selected one while the fetch is pending, and a stale context percentage
      (e.g. 86%) never persists under the new session.
    - showEmpty invalidates pending history and clears the transcript.
    - messages.clear removes the stream cursor and resets isPinned, the
      scrollToBottom visibility, and scrollTop, so a stale frame cannot
      repopulate a removed node.
    - canSend() reports that a turn may start only when nothing is busy and no
      session transition is in flight, kept separate from isBusy() so the
      composer Stop path does not fire during a create/delete transition.
    - send() rejects while a transition is in flight.
    - The composer submit handler retains the typed draft when a send is blocked
      by a transition, and ignores empty prompts.

